  <body>
    <div class="wrap">
      <header class="top">
        <a class="mark" href="/">
          <img src="/favicon.svg" width="26" height="26" alt="" />
          Blobdom
        </a>
        <div id="authbar"></div>
      </header>

      <main>
        <section class="hero">
          <div class="rise">
            <p class="caps">Free · in the browser · nothing to install</p>
            <h1>A tiny multiplayer blob world.</h1>
            <p class="lede">
              Blobs on a white field. A hundred coins that never respawn, a shop of spells you cast
              by typing them, and clans that plant flags to hold ground.
            </p>
            <div class="cta-row">
              <a class="play" href="/play">
                Play now
                <svg class="arrow" width="15" height="10" viewBox="0 0 15 10" aria-hidden="true">
                  <path
                    d="M1 5h12M9.5 1.5 13 5l-3.5 3.5"
                    fill="none"
                    stroke="currentColor"
                    stroke-width="1.6"
                    stroke-linecap="round"
                    stroke-linejoin="round"
                  />
                </svg>
              </a>
              <p class="online caps" id="online" aria-live="polite">
                <span class="dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                <span id="online-label">Counting who is out there…</span>
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          
          <div class="window rise">
            <div class="preview">
              <iframe
                src="/spectate?scale=1.5"
                title="Live view of the Blobdom world"
                loading="eager"
              ></iframe>
              <a class="preview-hit" href="/play" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true"></a>
              <span class="preview-chip caps"><i class="dot"></i>Live</span>
              <p class="preview-enter caps">Step in →</p>
            </div>
            <p class="preview-cap caps">Following whoever is doing something</p>
          </div>
        </section>

        
        <section class="whats-next rise" id="whats-next" hidden>
          <h2 class="head">What's next</h2>
          <p class="note">
            While a party is on, everybody can cast <span class="word">party</span> — no shop, no
            coins. <a href="/calendar">The whole calendar →</a>
          </p>
          <ol class="next" id="next"></ol>
        </section>

        <section class="panels">
          <section class="rise">
            <h2 class="head">How to play</h2>
            <p class="note">Five things, and you know the whole game.</p>
            <ol class="steps">
              <li>
                <span class="n" aria-hidden="true">1</span>
                <h3>Walk</h3>
                <p>
                  Click the ground and your blob walks there — tap it on a phone. Your gaze follows
                  the cursor, and the wheel or a pinch zooms.
                </p>
              </li>
              <li>
                <span class="n" aria-hidden="true">2</span>
                <h3>Haul</h3>
                <p>
                  Press an object and drag it: boulders, bombs, mushrooms, somebody else's flag.
                  Coins are collected by hauling one onto your blob — and you spill what you are
                  carrying when you die.
                </p>
              </li>
              <li>
                <span class="n" aria-hidden="true">3</span>
                <h3>Talk</h3>
                <p>
                  Just type. The letters appear over your head for a few seconds, for anyone
                  standing close enough to read them.
                </p>
              </li>
              <li>
                <span class="n" aria-hidden="true">4</span>
                <h3>Cast</h3>
                <p>
                  A spell is a word: type <span class="word">fast</span>,
                  <span class="word">hide</span>, <span class="word">fire</span> or
                  <span class="word">wind</span> and press <kbd>Enter</kbd>. You buy them in the
                  shop with the coins you hauled home.
                </p>
              </li>
              <li>
                <span class="n" aria-hidden="true">5</span>
                <h3>Claim</h3>
                <p>
                  Found a clan, invite the people you like, buy it a pennant — then cast
                  <span class="word">flag</span> to plant one where you stand. It keeps standing
                  after you log off, until somebody drags it away or blows it up.
                </p>
              </li>
            </ol>
          </section>

          <section class="rise">
            <h2 class="head">Clans holding ground</h2>
            <p class="note">Flags standing in the world right now, most first.</p>
            <ol class="board" id="board"></ol>
            <p class="empty" id="board-empty" hidden>
              No flags standing. Every acre of it is unclaimed.
            </p>
            <p class="foot-note">
              A clan buys one pennant and every member plants it, so a clan's ground all flies the
              same design. A flag outlives whoever planted it — it stands until somebody hauls it
              away or blows it up.
            </p>
          </section>
        </section>

        <section class="follow rise">
          <div>
            <h2 class="head">Follow along</h2>
            <p>
              Clips from the world, new spells as they reach the shop, and whatever strange thing
              happened out there last night.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="channels">
            <a
              class="channel tiktok"
              href="https://www.tiktok.com/@blobdom"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              aria-label="Blobdom on TikTok"
            >
              <svg
                width="16"
                height="16"
                viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                fill="currentColor"
                aria-hidden="true"
              >
